{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "schinese", "appid": 548430, "month": "2020-07", "window": 4, "start_date": 1595548800, "end_date": 1596239999, "month_true_total": 221, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:54:19 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "73561025", "author": {"steamid": "76561198298373059", "personaname": "入机", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/STTW_XL/", "num_games_owned": 55, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 60839, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 694, "last_played": 1770123873, "avatar": "084af891daa18ba206ff6cf6bf399b4233377b2b"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "个人很喜欢这个游戏，就是喜欢这种共同闯关挖掘的感觉，主要是和好友一起开黑是真的快乐（主要是还能炸队友XD）。当然这个游戏还有很多进步的空间，比如怪兽种类还是不太丰富，职业要是再多一俩个就更好了，然后最好能给个关卡时间过长会给提示，比如20分钟后会给个什么准确坐标，因为有时候找路是真的找到头疼，再来个时间通关会多给奖励就完美了。", "timestamp_created": 1596202390, "timestamp_updated": 1596202390, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "73557421", "author": {"steamid": "76561198858661628", "personaname": "czzw5", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/czzw5/", "num_games_owned": 134, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 11630, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1950, "last_played": 1719242033, "avatar": "fdfe5a891dfa313ca62c59a5ee9bfe7666a3bb59"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "好评如潮的游戏不多，好评如潮的游戏也一定有它的道理。\n挖矿加联机加打枪，地形均可破坏，那是不是我的世界不能搭房子，L4D不能蹲，事实上不止这么爽，香真的香，90块很值，DLC皮肤也值。\n当然也有些缺点，比如鼠标左键射击是不是大家都都有些问题？（一起联机的人都反应有失灵的现象，排除硬件原因）\n", "timestamp_created": 1596196115, "timestamp_updated": 1596196115, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "73556935", "author": {"steamid": "76561198209151313", "personaname": "小坤", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/1023693665/", "num_games_owned": 60, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 9504, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3534, "last_played": 1716213941, "avatar": "8a78a24d3ae3031caf2695bc4dede2d6eb7af7cf"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "无论是跟朋友玩，还是跟路人玩，都是很不错的体验。难度适中，画面不算精美但是该有的都有。bug还有一些，希望免费的皮肤能多一些。", "timestamp_created": 1596195216, "timestamp_updated": 1596195216, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "73529265", "author": {"steamid": "76561198188046298", "personaname": "sophia", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198188046298/", "num_games_owned": 255, "num_reviews": 25, "playtime_forever": 18429, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5720, "last_played": 1687349285, "avatar": "7db0f21fe125768847388e7dd9b2de4a42d7d668"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "上头，四个职业特点鲜明，都很有意思", "timestamp_created": 1596138683, "timestamp_updated": 1596138683, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "73513176", "author": {"steamid": "76561198420596607", "personaname": "BIGOPPAI", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://stea